Groomax – Pet Grooming Website
A responsive single-page website for Groomax, a premium pet grooming service. This project features a modern UI, multi-section navigation, modal pop-ups for booking and login, and visually engaging components, all built with HTML5, CSS3 (Bootstrap), and JavaScript.

🚀 Features
Responsive navigation bar (Bootstrap) with logo, menu links, and login button

Home landing section with call-to-action and welcome imagery

Dog Grooming section: service highlights, cards with images

Services section: visual grid of top offerings

Animated counters for pets hosted, services offered, happy clients

Team section: meet the staff with overlay information

Contact section: phone, address, social icons, gallery, working hours

Book Now modal with styled form for bookings

Login modal with role selection (User/Admin)

Custom styles from Google Fonts and home.css

Interactive scripts with Home.js and form.js

