🌐 Deployment
This includes all static files. To deploy:

Upload the entire project folder—keeping the /images folder and case exactly as in your code—to your web server, Vercel, Netlify, or GitHub Pages.

Ensure the entry point is index.html.

All images and assets should stay under /images relative to your HTML.

📝 Usage
Home Page: Features brand, hero images, and a CTA ("Groom Now").

About, Services, Team, Contact: Use navbar to navigate; sections include cards, modals, and contact details.

Booking Slot: Click "Groom Now" for the modal booking form.

Login: Click "Login" in the navbar for admin/user access modal.

⚠️ Troubleshooting
If images do not load on deployment, check:

That the /images folder and all image filenames match case exactly

Paths in your HTML/CSS/JS match the deployed folder structure

All assets are present and visible on the server

